# Elevator Calculation Engine

All calculations must use `decimal.js` or `big.js` for arbitrary-precision arithmetic. Never use JavaScript `number` for pricing.

Formula references are in `docs/elevator-calc-formulas.md`.

When adding a new calculation parameter:
1. Add to `CalcInputDto` with class-validator decorators
2. Add to the Drizzle schema in `src/database/schema/elevator-specs.ts`
3. Add a unit test in `src/modules/elevator-calc/elevator-calc.service.spec.ts`
4. Update the formula documentation

The `calculateSpecs()` method in `ElevatorCalcService` is the single entry point. All sub-calculations are private methods.
